# Implementation Plan - Shared Components, White Card Redesign & Build Fix

The objective is to refactor global UI components into a `shared` directory, redesign the authentication forms into a centered, white-card layout, and resolve the build error caused by Client/Server component mismatches.

## Proposed Changes

### [Architecture & Shared Components]
#### [NEW] [Header.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/shared/Header.tsx)
- Create a [Header](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/shared/Header.tsx#7-18) component that encapsulates the [Navbar](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/shared/Navbar.tsx#9-59).
- Ensure consistent styling and layout.

#### [NEW] [Footer.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/shared/Footer.tsx)
- Implement a global [Footer](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/shared/Footer.tsx#6-32) with essential links and branding.
- Match the new clean aesthetic.

#### [MOVE/MODIFY] [Navbar.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/shared/Navbar.tsx)
- Move from `/ui` to `/shared`.
- Refine design to integrate seamlessly with the new [Header](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/shared/Header.tsx#7-18).

### [Authentication Redesign]
#### [MODIFY] [AuthCard.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthCard.tsx)
- **Visual Overhaul**: Wrap forms in a high-quality **white card**.
- **Centering**: Use `flex justify-center items-center` for perfect screen centering.
- **Typography**: Balance font colors (likely dark text for the white card components) while maintaining the user's "font blanco" preference where appropriate (likely background elements or headers).
- **Optimization**: Improve spacing and layout for a more compact and professional look.

#### [MODIFY] [layout.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/layout.tsx)
- Integrate newly created [Header](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/shared/Header.tsx#7-18) and [Footer](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/shared/Footer.tsx#6-32).
- Update import paths for the moved [Navbar](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/shared/Navbar.tsx#9-59).

### [Build Factor]
#### [MODIFY] [Header.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/shared/Header.tsx)
- [DELETE] Remove `"use client"` directive.
- Keep as an `async` Server Component to safely call [getAuthenticatedUser](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/modules/users/users.service.ts#121-151).

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- **Structural Integrity**: Verify the new `shared` folder structure and component imports.
- **Design Check**: Confirm the auth forms are centered in a white card with improved spacing.
- **Navigation**: Test that the Header/Navbar and Footer appear correctly across pages.
- **Responsiveness**: Ensure the centered card layout works well on various screen sizes.
